erm="공군은"/><category scheme="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#" term="공대지"/><category scheme="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#" term="있다"/><title type='text'>F-15K Slam Eagle(F-15K 슬램이글)</title><content type='html'>&lt;style&gt;
